  6253                          ; AES-128 CTR-MODUS
  6254                          ; ================================================================
  6255                          ; AES_CTR_CRYPT  -  AES-128 CTR-modus  (encrypt = decrypt)
  6256                          ;
  6257                          ; Input (set before JSR AES_CTR_CRYPT):
  6258                          ;   AES_NONCE+0..+11   12-byte nonce
  6259                          ;   AES_CTR_IN+0/+1    lo/hi address of source buffer (plaintext or ciphertext)
  6260                          ;   AES_CTR_OUT+0/+1   lo/hi address of destination buffer
  6261                          ;   AES_CTR_LEN        berichtlengte 1..255 bytes
  6262                          ;   AES_RK already filled via JSR AES_SETKEY
  6263                          ;
  6264                          ; Output: destination buffer filled with (de)crypted result
  6265                          ; CTR is symmetrisch: encrypt = decrypt
  6266                          ;
  6267                          ; Counter: big-endian 32-bit, starts $00000002 (GCM-compatible)
  6268                          ; Implementation: self-modifying LDA/STA abs,Y (no zero-page)
  6269                          ; AES_CTR_REM guards termination (no BOFF overflow at 241..255 bytes)
  6270                          ; ================================================================
