  7374                          ; Rotate/shift on fixed scratch word SHA_TA (8 bytes, LE)
  7375                          ;   SHA_N = number of bits.  ROTR_TA = rotate right; SHR_TA = shift right.
  7376                          ; ================================================================
  7377                          ; --- 1-bit right rotation of SHA_TA (LE) ---
  7378  792b ad1093             ROR1_TA LDA SHA_TA+0
  7379  792e 4a                         LSR                     ; C = bit0 (wrap bit -> becomes MSB)
  7380  792f a207                       LDX #7
