  7389  793e ca                         DEX
  7390  793f 10fa                       BPL S1_L
  7391  7941 60                         RTS
  7392                          
  7393                          ; --- byte right rotation of SHA_TA by SHA_BK bytes (LE: out[i]=in[(i+k)&7]) ---
