  7423  797a f009                       BEQ RT_DN
  7424  797c 202b79                     JSR ROR1_TA
  7425  797f ce029a                     DEC SHA_BC
  7426  7982 4c7779                     JMP RT_BL
  7427  7985 60                 RT_DN   RTS
